      <section class="section policy-content">
        <p>This policy explains how this website uses cookies and similar browser storage.</p>
        <h2>Current Cookie Use</h2>
        <p>The website currently uses essential browser storage to remember whether you accepted or rejected optional cookies. This preference is stored in your browser so the cookie banner does not keep appearing.</p>
        <h2>Optional Cookies</h2>
        <p>We do not currently load analytics, advertising or marketing cookies. If optional analytics or marketing tools are added later, they should only be activated after you choose "Accept optional cookies".</p>
        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>The site loads fonts from Google Fonts and animation scripts from jsDelivr. These services may receive technical information such as your IP address and browser details when your browser requests those files.</p>
        <h2>Your Choice</h2>
        <p>You can accept or reject optional cookies using the banner. Rejecting optional cookies will not stop you using the website.</p>
        <p><button class="button secondary" type="button" data-cookie-reset>Change cookie preference</button></p>
        <h2>Browser Controls</h2>
        <p>You can also delete cookies and local storage through your browser settings. Blocking some browser storage may affect preference saving, but the main website content should remain available.</p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>For cookie or privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:support@animatesocialcare.co.uk">support@animatesocialcare.co.uk</a>.</p>
      </section>
